    {
      "url": "https://api.tsuki.page/api/v1/pages/path/doraemon/home",
      "data": {
        "title": "Home",
        "slug": "home",
        "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.tsuki.page/wikis/doraemon/10a3b61e05b1417aa0029f040a65a920.png\" class=\"align-left\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>This wiki is a collaborative English-language encyclopedia dedicated to the world of <em>Doraemon</em>. What makes this project unique is its focus on the <strong>Indian release order</strong> of episodes, movies, and content, rather than the original Japanese sequence.</p><p>Our goal is to create a reliable, and accessible resource for fans who experienced <em>Doraemon</em> through its Indian broadcasts and releases.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Some Links:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://tsuki.page/wiki/doraemon/1979-2005\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1979-2005</a>     <a href=\"https://tsuki.page/wiki/doraemon/2005-present\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> 2005-Present </a>    <a href=\"https://tsuki.page/wiki/doraemon/movies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Movies</a></p>",
